{"src":"ru","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":213700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ru","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":10497.498478,"text":"В 1990 году он был добавлен в список всемирного наследия, находящегося под угрозой из-за опасности со стороны песков в пустыне."},{"kind":"text","t":10908.259702000001,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in danger due to the threat from desert sands."},{"kind":"audio","t":10944.317109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10945.8824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10947.454052000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10949.112195,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":10950.689456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10952.271507000001,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":24571.420211,"text":"Если вы смотрели фильм «Сокровища нации», то можете подумать, что на оборотной стороне Декларации независимости была изображена карта сокровищ."},{"kind":"text","t":25015.964087,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie “National Treasure,” you might think that a map of treasures was depicted on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":25065.079464000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25066.290858,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25067.948051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25069.645715,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25071.250817,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25072.877079,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25074.284917,"samples":30792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":36406.723438999994,"text":"Тети передаются под опеку по множеству разнообразных причин. От беспризорности до жестокого обращения и даже вымогательств."},{"kind":"text","t":36659.116851,"text":"Aunties are placed under guardianship for a variety of reasons. From homelessness to abuse and even extortion."},{"kind":"audio","t":36699.664688,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36701.261909999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":36702.924332999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":36703.448214,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":130},{"kind":"audio","t":36736.300607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36737.678934999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":36738.797506999996,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":45697.735760999996,"text":"Долина Качама – главное направление в Чире для альпинизма. Она известна как Йосмит Южной Америки и имеет большое количество..."},{"kind":"text","t":46058.277565,"text":"The Cachama Valley is the main destination in Chiré for mountaineering. She is known as the Yosemite of South America and has a vast number of..."},{"kind":"audio","t":46100.816622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46102.163928999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46103.828762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46105.495384999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"audio","t":46105.616236999995,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":46139.120714,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46140.73867599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46142.339508,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46143.826367999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"audio","t":46143.967940999995,"samples":1528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":48894.535790999995,"text":"больших гранитных стен и скал."},{"kind":"text","t":49016.255162999994,"text":"large granite walls and rocks."},{"kind":"audio","t":49053.803889999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49055.746469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":49055.972353,"samples":1064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":57751.385233999994,"text":"Во всех научных вопросах, включая психологию, были приняты взгляды Аристотеля."},{"kind":"text","t":57986.960342,"text":"In all scientific matters, including psychology, Aristotle’s views were accepted."},{"kind":"audio","t":58032.590019999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58034.231611999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58035.890965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58037.490766999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58038.439315999996,"samples":23728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":68127.342835,"text":"Если вы не привыкли ездить по сельским дорогам, будьте начеку. Преобладают крутые склоны, узкие переулки и резкие повороты."},{"kind":"text","t":68431.343173,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, be cautious. Steep slopes, narrow alleys, and sharp turns predominate."},{"kind":"audio","t":68473.833319,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68475.21077599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68476.92201,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":68477.036483,"samples":3696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":68511.50751899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68512.85741499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68514.511818,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":68514.60848,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":77270.830351,"text":"Наличие настоящей невидимой команды. Ларсон и Лафаста, 1989 год, страница 109."},{"kind":"text","t":77660.68132799999,"text":"The existence of a true invisible team. Larson and LaFasta, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":77699.23475599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77700.803587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77701.47239,"samples":18464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"audio","t":77739.042158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77740.427025,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77742.010587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77743.284992,"samples":28896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":81710.82222999999,"text":"также является уникальным компонентом виртуальной команды."},{"kind":"text","t":81901.532146,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":81929.502375,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81930.818611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81932.206289,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":87149.81283,"text":"После несчастного случая Гибсон был доставлен в больницу, но вскоре скончался."},{"kind":"text","t":87397.415153,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to the hospital but died shortly thereafter."},{"kind":"audio","t":87441.291799,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87442.259308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87443.87913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87445.50257299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":87445.83419899999,"samples":11728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":97845.446308,"text":"В немецкой выпечке часто используются миндаль, фундук и другие древесные орехи. Зачастую популярные торты отлично сочетаются с чашкой крепкого кофе."},{"kind":"text","t":98187.079178,"text":"Almond, walnut, and other tree nuts are often used in German pastries. Popular cakes often pair well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":98230.644157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98232.02165499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98233.672408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98235.436103,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":98235.541105,"samples":5128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":98255.50889299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":98257.007363,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":98258.668307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":98258.804859,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":104676.901332,"text":"Очевидно, что если владеешь языком романской подгруппы, тебе будет проще выучить португальский."},{"kind":"text","t":104982.88212,"text":"Obviously, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":105025.567342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105026.97091,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105028.461129,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105030.120182,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105030.98526,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":113893.06468699999,"text":"Звуковое и световое шоу на фоне пирамиды является одним из самых интересных мероприятий в этой местности для детей."},{"kind":"text","t":114254.96208099999,"text":"The sound and light show in front of the pyramid is one of the most interesting attractions in this area for children."},{"kind":"audio","t":114299.622162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114301.04646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114302.628772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114304.30664499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114305.981489,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114306.618402,"samples":18560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":123627.29719499999,"text":"Изучение движения отдельных водителей и автомобилей между двумя точками и их взаимодействия друг с другом осуществляется в рамках исследования транспортных потоков."},{"kind":"text","t":124056.8649,"text":"The study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and their interactions with each other is conducted as part of traffic flow research."},{"kind":"audio","t":124108.324767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124109.67131399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124111.268606,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124112.827167,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":124114.46849,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124116.154384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":124117.805836,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124119.52114099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":124119.650933,"samples":7856,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":131894.885059,"text":"Австралиец Митчелл Гурли пришел к финишу 11 в соревнованиях по супергиганту для мужчин в классе стоя."},{"kind":"text","t":132222.06974,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley finished 11th in the men’s standing super giant slalom competition."},{"kind":"audio","t":132265.000837,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132266.678001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132268.31814299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132270.028027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132271.788933,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":132271.914315,"samples":5960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":139085.317969,"text":"Чех Олдрич Еленек пришел к финишу 16 в соревнованиях по супергиганту для мужчин в классе сидя."},{"kind":"text","t":139452.119531,"text":"Czech Oldřich Helenek finished 16th in the men’s sitting super giant slalom competition."},{"kind":"audio","t":139496.041867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139497.445206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139499.26194199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139500.905395,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":139501.903294,"samples":24328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":152021.038611,"text":"Гаитянский институт справедливости и демократии сослался на независимое исследование, которое предполагает, что в России есть несколько стран, которые не имеют права на право на действие."},{"kind":"text","t":152488.021172,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited an independent study suggesting that there are several countries in Russia that do not have the right to take action."},{"kind":"audio","t":152537.941039,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152539.588742,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152541.163823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152542.772405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":152544.456869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152546.132192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152547.696934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152549.355657,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152550.480639,"samples":25856,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":152712.466593,"text":"что непальский миротворческий батальон ООН непреднамеренно завез заболевание в Гаити."},{"kind":"text","t":152983.167736,"text":"That the UN Nepalese peacekeeping battalion inadvertently introduced the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":153027.289257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":153028.781547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153030.363718,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153031.993581,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153033.750466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":153033.863038,"samples":4160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":159347.21048,"text":"Вскоре после начала военных действий Британия устроила морскую блокаду Германии."},{"kind":"text","t":159606.381194,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":159647.112757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159648.73694899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":159650.27388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159651.931783,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159653.398202,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":168700.68581599998,"text":"Он также атаковал все, что входило в воду. Даже гигантский динозавр, такой как тираннозавр, не сравнился бы с ним."},{"kind":"text","t":169025.722344,"text":"It also attacked everything that was in the water. Even a giant dinosaur like a Tyrannosaurus wouldn’t compare to it."},{"kind":"audio","t":169065.815844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169067.462987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169068.400146,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"audio","t":169105.055528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169106.462966,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169108.044737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169108.837113,"samples":20496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":178166.177172,"text":"Использование видеозаписи привело к важным открытиям в сфере интерпретации микровыражений."},{"kind":"text","t":178457.752782,"text":"The use of video recordings has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of microexpressions."},{"kind":"audio","t":178501.08873699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178502.690429,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178504.329631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178505.932053,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":178507.610457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178508.621247,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"input","t":182406.385172,"text":"Движение лица длительностью несколько миллисекунд."},{"kind":"text","t":182556.729823,"text":"Facial movements lasting a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":182596.452546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":182597.835984,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":182598.78629299998,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":192709.015916,"text":"Заявление было сделано после того, как Трамп провел телефонный разговор с президентом Турции Реджипом Таипом Эрдоганом."},{"kind":"text","t":193029.644466,"text":"The statement was made after Trump had a phone call with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":193072.793477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193074.509351,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193076.160034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193077.742136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193079.336498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":193079.44425,"samples":1160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":202294.961753,"text":"Это иногда переполнено народом семейные пляжи с хорошим выбором магазинов, расположенных вдоль берега. Плавать безопасно."},{"kind":"text","t":202680.254094,"text":"These are family beaches that are sometimes crowded with people, offering a good selection of shops along the shore. Swimming is safe."},{"kind":"audio","t":202727.974456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202729.356624,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202731.014767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":202732.68602,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202734.329403,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202735.256452,"samples":21560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"audio","t":202761.350232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202761.524756,"samples":12832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":212521.029167,"text":"Почти все более мелкие острова являются независимыми государствами или ассоциированы с Францией и известны как шикарные пляжные курорты."},{"kind":"text","t":212879.649076,"text":"Almost all of the smaller islands are independent states or associated with France, and are known as luxurious beach resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":212925.648884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212927.300957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212928.883929,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":212930.549722,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212932.279726,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212933.96189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":212935.05622199998,"samples":25992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"close","t":223705.21057,"code":1005}]}